        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Zheng He</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">1371 CE – c. 1433 CE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Born</span><span class="info-stat-val">1371, as Ma He, in Kunyang, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kunming">Kunming</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yunnan">Yunnan</a>; of a Muslim (Hui) family descended from Sayyid Ajjal Shams al-Din Omar, governor of Yunnan under the Yuan</span></div>
